<li>Pepall, L., Richards, D.J., Norman, G. (2005). Industrial Organization: Contemporary Theory and Practice. Mason: Thomson South-Western.</li>
<li>Porter, M. (1985). Competitive Advantage: Creating and Sustaining Superior Performance. New York: Free Press.</li>
